{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32995","headline":"题濮庙 · 曹邺","name":"题濮庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓祭瑶斋夜扣钟，鳌头风起浪重重。\n人间直有仙桃种，海上应无肉马踪。\n赤水梦沈迷象罔，翠华恩断泣芙蓉。\n不知皇帝三宫驻，始向人间着衮龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}